File name of the quadrupole tensor. <br>
This tag is required when you use the quadrupole tensor obtained from DFT calculation. <br>
</p>
<pre>
    File format is the following :
    \todo \\Ref other page 
</pre>
<p><b>Data Type:</b> String (File path) </p>
<p><b>Default:</b> - </p>
<p><b>Example:</b> \code qd_tensorfile : "filepath" \endcode </p>
<p><b>Related Tags:</b> \ref tag_qd_readmode "qd_readmode" \ref tag_qd_cutoff "qd_cutoff" \ref tag_qd_tensorfile_woqubit "qd_tensorfile_woqubit" \ref tag_qd_cell_para "cell_para" </p>
<p><b>Related variable:</b> \ref Config::qd_tensorfile </p>

