File name of the quadrupole tensor without qubit. <br>
This would be useful for coherence simultion in the strained or bubble structure. <br>
This tag is required when you use the quadrupole tensor obtained from DFT calculation. <br>
</p>
<pre>
    File format is the following :
    \todo \\Ref other page
</pre>
<p><b>Data Type:</b> String (File path) </p>
