<p><b>Example:</b> \code qd_tensorfile_woqubit : "filepath" \endcode </p>
<p><b>Related Tags:</b> \ref tag_qd_readmode "qd_readmode" \ref tag_qd_cutoff "qd_cutoff" \ref tag_qd_tensorfile "qd_tensorfile" \ref tag_qd_cell_para "cell_para" </p>
