\anchor tag_Qubit
## Qubit
<p><b>Description:</b><br>
Qubit information. <br>
This tag is required to give the details of qubit information. <br></p>
<p><b>Data Type:</b> Dictionary </p>
<p><b>Default:</b> - </p>
<p><b>Example:</b> 
    \code Qubit : { "nqubit" : 2, 
                    "qubit" : [ { "name" : "Q1", "spin" : 0.5, "gyro" : -17608.597050, "xyz" : [1.0, 2.0, 3.0], "detuning" : 0.0, "alphams" : 0, "betams" : 1 }, 
                                 { "name" : "Q2", "spin" : 1.0, "gyro" : -17608.597050, "xyz" : [4.0, 5.0, 6.0], "detuning" : 0.0, "alphams" : 0, "betams" : 1 } ] } \endcode </p>
<p><Related variable:</b> \ref QubitArray "QubitArray struct", \ref Qubit "Qubit struct" </p> 
<p><b>Sub-tags:</b></p>
<p>
    - \ref tag_nqubit "nqubit" 
    - \ref tag_qubit "qubit" 
    - \ref tag_intmap "intmap" 
    - \ref tag_psia "psia"
    - \ref tag_psib "psib"
    - \ref tag_psi0 "psi0"
    - \ref tag_overhaus "overhaus"
    - \ref tag_alphaidx "alphaidx"
    - \ref tag_betaidx "betaidx"
</p>

