\anchor tag_nqubit
## nqubit
<p><b>Description:</b><br>
Number of qubits in the system. <br>
The number of qubit information in tag \ref tag_Qubit "Qubit" should be the same as this value. <br>
<p><b>Data Type:</b> Integer </p>
<p><b>Default:</b> - </p>
<p><b>Example:</b> \code nqubit : 2 \endcode </p>
<p><b>Related variable:</b> \ref QubitArray::nqubit </p>

\anchor tag_qubit
## qubit
<p><b>Description:</b><br>
Qubit information details, e.g. qubit name, spin number, gyro magnetic ratio, etc.. <br>
This tag is required to give the details of qubit information. <br></p>
<p><b>Data Type:</b> Dictionary List </p>
<p><b>Default:</b> - </p>
<p><b>Example:</b> 
    \code qubit : [ { "name" : "Q1", "spin" : 0.5, "gyro" : -17608.597050, "xyz" : [1.0, 2.0, 3.0], "detuning" : 0.0, "alphams" : 0, "betams" : 1 }, 
                    { "name" : "Q2", "spin" : 1.0, "gyro" : -17608.597050, "xyz" : [4.0, 5.0, 6.0], "detuning" : 0.0, "alphams" : 0, "betams" : 1 } ] \endcode </p>
<p><b>Related variable:</b> \ref Qubit "Qubit struct"  </p>
<p><b>Sub-tags:</b></p>
<p>
    - \ref tag_name "name" : Bath spin name
    - \ref tag_spin "spin" : Spin number
    - \ref tag_gyro "gyro" : Gyromagnetic ratio \(rad/ms/G\)
    - \ref tag_xyz "xyz"   : x,y,z position of qubit in cartesian, angstrom
    - \ref tag_detuning "detuning" : Detuning frequency \(kHz\)
    - \ref tag_alphams "alphams"   : qubit sublevel state
    - \ref tag_betams "betams"     : qubit sublevel state
</p>

