\anchor tag_alphams
## alphams
<p><b>Description:</b><br>
Alpha state of the qubit. <br>
Represents one of the effective spin states of the qubit. <br>
Priority: \ref tag_psia "psia" > \ref tag_alphaidx "alphaidx" > \ref tag_alphams "alphams". <br>
This tag is ultimately applied to set \ref QubitArray::psia \(i.e. \ref tag_psia "psia"\), unless it is overridden by a higher-priority tag <br>
<p><b>Data Type:</b> Float </p>
<p><b>Default:</b> 1.0 </p>
<p><b>Example:</b> \code alphams : 1.0 \endcode </p>
<p><b>Related-tags:</b> \ref tag_betams "betams" \ref tag_psia "psia" \ref tag_alphaidx "alphaidx" </p>
